Z||000006||FieroLisa||02-21-2001||01:52 PM||||Well I don't think I can be there that weekend, since I am coming up that upcoming Thursday...can't drive 14 hours the weekend before. But I will be there for a week before Daytona show if anyone wants another informal gathering- I barely know anyone in Greensboro, I'll be bored!<P>------------------<BR>Lisa<BR>86 gold 4 speed GT<BR>AOL IM: FieroLisa<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>FieroLisa's Website</A><BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ncfieros/" TARGET=_blank>Tarheels Fieros Website</A><BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/pffsig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000007||bHooper||02-21-2001||03:22 PM||||Lisa, I'm that boring, am I?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><P>Beside's will have fun installing those springs... that'll take a couple of days, because the 12 hours of Sebring is that Saturday (that's a can't miss if the satelite is working properly), and you can probably convince Melinda to take you out to the barn.<P>When will you be getting in?  Do you want to work on the car saturday or sunday?<P>------------------<BR>hoop<BR>Red '86 GT<BR>KYB's, Eibach's,<BR>Poly Bushings||||reg||1
